WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.470
The batting tracker

00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:05.510
Who really hits the best on your team?

00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:10.920
During the game, open the tracker: tonight’s game is there, with its lineup.

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:14.310
Home or away, and let’s go.

00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:19.000
Édouard is at bat. He hits a line drive.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.110
A single to centre field: he’s safe at first.

00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:27.960
Next: the following batter is already there, in lineup order.

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:32.690
At the end of the game, the team stats calculate themselves.

00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:37.830
And every player has their card: average, and where they hit the ball.

00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:43.240
BaseballLineup. Less paperwork, more baseball.
